"Extra Eyes for DWIs" is an effort that will involve seven local police agencies conducting saturation patrols in all seven jurisdictions on Halloween night ([this] Thursday, October 31). The police officers will be specifally looking for drunk drivers, in an effort to keep them off the streets.[][][][][][][]


